(7669080, 1251486, 98565, '<td valign="top">A wonderful picture, Congrats on the red ribbon!<br/> <br/>This reminds me of a very much beloved song of the German singer/songwriter Reinhard Mey (almost everybody in Germany knows this song!)<br/> <br/>The chorus is:<br/>Above the clouds<br/>freedom must be limitless<br/>all fears, all worries, they say<br/>stay underneath and then<br/>what seems big and important to us <br/>is suddenly void and small<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ICfNCLSnd4" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Über den Wolken</a></td>', 'A wonderful picture, Congrats on the red ribbon! This reminds me of a very much beloved song of the German singer/songwriter Reinhard Mey (almost everybody in Germany knows this song!) The chorus is:Above the cloudsfreedom must be limitlessall fears, all worries, they saystay underneath and thenwhat seems big and important to us is suddenly void and small Über den Wolken', '2020-07-08 07:09:05.000000', NULL, 0),
